WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:01.767
- Well, what's the most amazing golf shot

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:03.020
that you've ever made?

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:06.870
- Oh, recently actually
recently I was competing

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:11.070
in this college golf showcase,
not in college myself,

00:00:11.070 --> 00:00:14.390
but I was asked to join this
group and compete for charity.

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:17.260
So, it was like Darius
Rucker and myself were

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:22.060
on a team and Jerome
Bettis and Brian Urlacher,

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:23.970
they were on another team
and we had two college kids.

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:25.670
So, it was four against four.

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.070
We were playing out in
Arizona and we were losing

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:31.100
and it came down to the
last hole, the 18th hole,

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.147
final hole, final putt, $100,000 putt.

00:00:34.147 --> 00:00:35.810
- This is like a movie.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:37.667
- Yeah. It really felt like it.

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:41.500
$100,000 putt for charity
all the way across the green.

00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.720
I'm calling it 75 feet at least.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.176
And I make it.

00:00:46.176 --> 00:00:47.520
(audience clapping)
- I'm gonna be real with you.

00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:49.730
I've seen this and I
thought it was incredible.

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:50.880
So, I'm gonna show the tape.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.420
- Oh good!
- It's amazing.

00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:53.253
- [Riggle] Yes!

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.990
- [Commentator] Riggle for $100,000.

00:00:55.990 --> 00:00:58.213
I bet he likes the sounds of that.

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:02.523
- Yes!
(people cheering)

00:01:06.280 --> 00:01:07.197
- Let's go.

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:10.443
The golfers out there know.

00:01:10.443 --> 00:01:11.651
They know.
- They?

00:01:11.651 --> 00:01:12.502
- They know, they know.
- I'm not a golfer

00:01:12.502 --> 00:01:15.490
and you're a superhero to me right now.

00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:18.520
I watched that 'cause I was
like, oh he's come back on.

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:20.680
They were like, yeah, he's
this incredible golf shot.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:23.880
And I watched it last night
and I was like, screw this guy.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.200
I was like, you made that putt?

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.650
I was like, I couldn't,

00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:30.450
I can't even make it next to the hole.

00:01:30.450 --> 00:01:32.250
Like I'm real, I'm like Happy Gilmore.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.780
I can drive the ball, but
I can't putt for anything.

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:36.130
But that was incredible.

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:37.870
- I felt very blessed, very lucky.

00:01:37.870 --> 00:01:39.300
- Did you feel like you were flying.

00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:40.133
Did you feel like you were

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:40.966
- I did.
- the coolest person

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:41.799
in the world?

00:01:41.799 --> 00:01:42.632
- Can I tell you?

00:01:42.632 --> 00:01:45.810
I actually had, the honest reaction.

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:48.570
I turned into a soccer player.

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:51.360
All of a sudden I'd ran
away from my teammates

00:01:51.360 --> 00:01:53.930
and I ran away and it was
like, "Look what I did."

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:55.690
And then I realized, oh, don't do that.

00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:57.560
And I turned around and ran back to them.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.512
So, you can actually see it.

00:01:58.512 --> 00:01:59.830
- That's exciting.
- I got embarrassed

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:01.820
that I ran away 'cause
I'm not a soccer player,

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:03.000
I'm a team player.

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:05.790
- I know, but whatever,
it was a great goal

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:06.623
if you're a soccer player.

00:02:06.623 --> 00:02:07.830
So, it's fine.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:08.920
You're incredible at golf.

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:10.170
So, there's that.

